  "body": "Spacious, architecturally designed family home, located in one of St Heliers' most desirable and tightly held positions.\r\n\r\nBeautifully appointed to capture an abundance of sun and natural light, this contemporary residence combines style, space and effortless living.\r\n\r\nDesigned with an excellent floor plan and superb indoor/outdoor flow, large floor-to-ceiling sliders open seamlessly to the choice of 2 outdoor spaces,complete with swimming pool and easy-care gardens-the perfect setting for year-round entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe bespoke kitchen is fitted with quality appliances, generous bench space and a thoughtfully designed scullery, while the open plan kitchen and dining area, complemented by two separate living spaces, makes entertaining both easy and inviting.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises five spacious bedrooms, all fitted with quality wardrobe systems, alongside two luxurious bathrooms, plus an extra powder room. . A well-considered laundry, excellent storage throughout and double internal access garaging complete this exceptional family home.\r\n\r\nWalking distance to St Heliers beach, parks, village and local amenities.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity to purchase in this incredible location.",
